.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dfdu-update 1  "dfdu-update " 
.SH NAME
dfdu\-update \- Check for a newer release of dfdu and install it over this one (checked against its published SHA\-256). A dfdu installed with Homebrew, Nix, Scoop, winget or a system package manager is left to it: the command to update it is printed instead
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdfdu update\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check for a newer release of dfdu and install it over this one (checked against its published SHA\-256). A dfdu installed with Homebrew, Nix, Scoop, winget or a system package manager is left to it: the command to update it is printed instead
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Only check whether a newer release is out; change nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Install the latest release even when this build is as new (to repair a copy)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
